Verse 1:
[Ab]God sent His [Eb7]Son, [Ab]they called [Gbdim]Him [Gb]Jesus,
[Db/F]He came [Ab]to [Db/Ab]love, heal, [Ab]and [Eb]forgive;
[Cm/G]He lived and died to [Gdim]buy my [Ab]pardon,
[Ab/Eb]An [Gb]empty [Db/F]grave [Ab]is there to prove my Savior [C7/Bb]lives.

Refrain:
[Eb]Because [Ab]He [Gdim]lives [Ab]I can face [Gbdim]tomorrow,
[Fm/Ab]Because He lives [Ab]all fear is gone;
[Eb7/Db]Because [Gdim]I [Ab]know [Bbm]He [Cm]holds [Ab]the [Gb]future.
[Db/Ab]And life [Ab]is worth the living just [Gdim]because [C/G]He [Gdim]lives.

Verse 2:
[Ab]How sweet to [Eb7]hold [Ab]a newborn [Gb]baby,
[Db/F]And feel [Ab]the [Db/Ab]pride, [Ab]and [Db/F]joy He [Eb]gives;
[Cm/G]But greater still the [Gdim]calm assurance,
[Ab/Eb]This [Gb]child [Gbdim]can [Db/F]face [Ab]uncertain days because [Cm/G]He [C7/Bb]lives.
